                        <a href="/bus-train-ferry/visitors-guide-to-public-transport-in-auckland" aria-label="Visitor&#x27;s guide to public transport in Auckland">Visitor&#x27;s guide to public transport in Auckland</a>
                </li>
        </ul>
                </nav>
            </div>
        </div>



<div id="main">
    


    <at-title-block theme="light" title-text="Public transport trips around Auckland" long-title=""
        te-reo-title="" page-introduction="Easy public transport journeys within 15 minutes of Auckland&#x2019;s city centre. Visit our popular attractions and find lesser-known places enjoyed by locals." background-url=""
        background-color-dark="#2c384c" background-color-light="#ffffff"
        enable-image-cropping="true">
    </at-title-block>


    <div id="AucklandCouncil"></div>
    
    <div class="at-basic-template at-font at-w-100 at-box-sizing-border at-css-grid at-rowgap-7 at-rowgap-md-8 at-pt-7 at-pt-md-8">
        <div class="at-subgrid at-rowgap-7 at-rowgap-md-8
            at-col-span-100 at-md:col-span-6 at-lg:col-span-9 at-xl:col-span-8
            at-md:col-start-2 at-xl:col-start-3">


        <at-page-index class="at-col-span-100" links='[{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;How to pay for public transport as a visitor&quot;,&quot;targetId&quot;:&quot;#index-4e3c01ef2b16a44a4829304dbb6affd80b50936ccfcfd2b60c5559a862f50261&quot;},{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;How often services run&quot;,&quot;targetId&quot;:&quot;#index-bd451c6c3817c1e58ddeaa77a1dc8b0a73144b04d68a370adf8eca5dfeb29723&quot;},{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;AT Mobile app&quot;,&quot;targetId&quot;:&quot;#index-09c118ee9c580facf5fafc5e53a83e0f965f57f65938fdf0fe56b3355fb68516&quot;},{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Day trips around Auckland&quot;,&quot;targetId&quot;:&quot;#index-69e7c2a27f5523e6fb643c2ec46422bc48d4fb8b9b61f76602f3140ad5c653cf&quot;}]'></at-page-index>
            





<at-text-block class="at-col-span-100" theme="white">

    <h2 id="index-4e3c01ef2b16a44a4829304dbb6affd80b50936ccfcfd2b60c5559a862f50261">How to pay for public transport as a visitor</h2>
<p>You can pay with:</p>
<ul>
<li>contactless debit or credit cards, smartphones or smart devices</li>
<li>AT HOP cards</li>
<li>paper tickets (only train and ferry services, not available on buses).</li>
</ul>


</at-text-block>
        <div class="at-col-span-100">
        <at-link
            type="standalone" 
            size="small" 
            href="/bus-train-ferry/fares-and-discounts/how-to-pay-for-public-transport" 
            label="How to pay for public transport" 
            theme="white">
        </at-link>
        </div>




<at-text-block class="at-col-span-100" theme="white">

    <h2 id="index-bd451c6c3817c1e58ddeaa77a1dc8b0a73144b04d68a370adf8eca5dfeb29723">How often services run</h2>
<p>All buses, trains and ferries mentioned on this page travel:</p>
<ul>
<li>at least every 15 minutes</li>
<li>7am to 7pm</li>
<li>7 days a week.</li>
</ul>
<p>No need for a timetable, just turn up and go.</p>
<h2 id="index-09c118ee9c580facf5fafc5e53a83e0f965f57f65938fdf0fe56b3355fb68516">AT Mobile app</h2>
<p>To plan and track journeys by foot, bike and across our bus, train and ferry services, download the AT Mobile app.</p>
<div id="downloadcontainer">
<div id="appbuttons">
<div><a style="width: 150px; margin-right: 12px; display: inline-block;" href="https://apps.apple.com/app/apple-store/id1207704356?utm_source=atwebsite&amp;utm_medium=landingpage&amp;utm_campaign=appdownload" data-anchor="?utm_source=atwebsite&amp;utm_medium=landingpage&amp;utm_campaign=appdownload"><img src="/media/1973570/app_badge_apple.png?width=150" alt="Download the AT Mobile app for the iPhone on the App Store" data-id="88298"></a> <a style="width: 150px; display: inline-block;" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=nz.govt.at.atmobile&amp;referrer=utm_source%3Datwebsite%26utm_medium%3Dlandingpage%26anid%3Dadmob?id=nz.govt.at.atmobile" data-anchor="?id=nz.govt.at.atmobile"><img src="/media/1992486/google-play-badge-no-margin.png?width=150" alt="Download the AT Mobile app for Android on the Google Play store" data-id="88299"></a></div>
</div>
</div>


</at-text-block>


<at-text-block class="at-col-span-100" theme="white">

    <h2 id="index-69e7c2a27f5523e6fb643c2ec46422bc48d4fb8b9b61f76602f3140ad5c653cf">Day trips around Auckland</h2>


</at-text-block>


<div class="at-col-span-100">

    <at-accordion theme="white" show-controls="show-controls">
        
            <at-accordion-section>
                <at-accordion-toggle 
                    subtitle="" 
                    toggle-id="toggle-u-accordion-1-0" 
                    panel-id="panel-u-accordion-1-0">
                    Shopping
                </at-accordion-toggle>

                <at-accordion-panel 
                    toggle-id="toggle-u-accordion-1-0" 
                    panel-id="panel-u-accordion-1-0">
                    
                    <div class="at-d-grid at-rowgap-6 at-rowgap-md-7 at-px-4 at-mb-4 at-mt-1">
                        






<at-text-block class="at-col-span-100" theme="white">

    <p>Enjoy a range of shopping experiences and New Zealand designers.</p>
<h5>Parnell village</h5>
<p>Parnell’s historic buildings are filled with boutique shops and art galleries. To get there, catch the bus from <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=7018+-+Stop+C+Queens+Arcade&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.8449%2C174.76779&amp;toAddress=7188+-+Parnell+Shops&amp;toCoordinates=-36.85301%2C174.77903" title="Britomart to Parnell" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=7018+-+Stop+C+Queens+Arcade&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.8449%2C174.76779&amp;toAddress=7188+-+Parnell+Shops&amp;toCoordinates=-36.85301%2C174.77903">Britomart (stop 7018)</a> or near the <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=1089+-+International+Convention+Centre&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.84964%2C174.76023&amp;toAddress=7188+-+Parnell+Shops&amp;toCoordinates=-36.85301%2C174.77903" title="Sky Tower to Parnell" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=1089+-+International+Convention+Centre&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.84964%2C174.76023&amp;toAddress=7188+-+Parnell+Shops&amp;toCoordinates=-36.85301%2C174.77903">Sky Tower (stop 1089)</a>. Ride 10 minutes then get off at the Parnell shops (stop 7188).</p>
<h5>Newmarket shops</h5>
<p>Next up is the enormous Westfield Newmarket shopping centre. Take the bus from the <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=7188+-+Parnell+Shops&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.85301%2C174.77903&amp;toAddress=7203+-+Stop+A+Westfield+Newmarket&amp;toCoordinates=-36.87071%2C174.7772" title="Parnell to Newmarket" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=7188+-+Parnell+Shops&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.85301%2C174.77903&amp;toAddress=7203+-+Stop+A+Westfield+Newmarket&amp;toCoordinates=-36.87071%2C174.7772">Parnell shops (7188)</a>. Ride 10 minutes then get off at stop 7203.</p>
<h5>Auckland city centre</h5>
<p>End the day with Commercial Bay’s luxury brands and award-winning restaurants. Take the train from <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=115+-+Newmarket+Train+Station&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.86972%2C174.77883&amp;toAddress=133+-+Waitemat%C4%81+Train+Station&amp;toCoordinates=-36.84429%2C174.76847" title="Newmarket to Waitematā" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=115+-+Newmarket+Train+Station&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.86972%2C174.77883&amp;toAddress=133+-+Waitemat%C4%81+Train+Station&amp;toCoordinates=-36.84429%2C174.76847">Newmarket Station</a> and ride 10 minutes to Waitematā Station.</p>


</at-text-block>



    <div class="at-col-span-100">
        <at-supporting-image
            fit="cover"
            image-title=""
            heading-level="h3"
            heading-style="atn-heading5"
            image-url="/media/lzkjfg4u/auckland-transport-street-friends-shopping.jpg?mode=crop&amp;width=1535&amp;format=jpg"
            image-alt="Shopping in Parnell."
            image-caption=""
