            <source slot="source" type="image/webp" media="(max-width: 359px)" srcset="/media/lzkjfg4u/auckland-transport-street-friends-shopping.jpg?mode=crop&amp;width=359&amp;format=webp">
            <source slot="source" type="image/webp" media="(max-width: 639px)" srcset="/media/lzkjfg4u/auckland-transport-street-friends-shopping.jpg?mode=crop&amp;width=639&amp;format=webp">
            <source slot="source" type="image/webp" media="(max-width: 1023px)" srcset="/media/lzkjfg4u/auckland-transport-street-friends-shopping.jpg?mode=crop&amp;width=1023&amp;format=webp">
            <source slot="source" type="image/webp" media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="/media/lzkjfg4u/auckland-transport-street-friends-shopping.jpg?mode=crop&amp;width=1535&amp;format=webp">

            <source slot="source" type="image/jpeg" media="(max-width: 359px)" srcset="/media/lzkjfg4u/auckland-transport-street-friends-shopping.jpg?mode=crop&amp;width=359&amp;format=jpg">
            <source slot="source" type="image/jpeg" media="(max-width: 639px)" srcset="/media/lzkjfg4u/auckland-transport-street-friends-shopping.jpg?mode=crop&amp;width=639&amp;format=jpg">
            <source slot="source" type="image/jpeg" media="(max-width: 1023px)" srcset="/media/lzkjfg4u/auckland-transport-street-friends-shopping.jpg?mode=crop&amp;width=1023&amp;format=jpg">
            <source slot="source" type="image/jpeg" media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="/media/lzkjfg4u/auckland-transport-street-friends-shopping.jpg?mode=crop&amp;width=1535&amp;format=jpg">
        </at-supporting-image>
    </div>



                    </div>

                </at-accordion-panel>
            </at-accordion-section>
            <at-accordion-section>
                <at-accordion-toggle 
                    subtitle="" 
                    toggle-id="toggle-u-accordion-1-1" 
                    panel-id="panel-u-accordion-1-1">
                    Food
                </at-accordion-toggle>

                <at-accordion-panel 
                    toggle-id="toggle-u-accordion-1-1" 
                    panel-id="panel-u-accordion-1-1">
                    
                    <div class="at-d-grid at-rowgap-6 at-rowgap-md-7 at-px-4 at-mb-4 at-mt-1">
                        






<at-text-block class="at-col-span-100" theme="white">

    <p>Create your own full-day food tour.</p>
<h5>Parnell</h5>
<p>Start the day off right with breakfast in Parnell. Catch the bus from <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-05T16%3A40%3A30%2B13%3A00&amp;time=4%3A45pm&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=7018+-+Stop+C+Queens+Arcade&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.8449%2C174.76779&amp;toAddress=7188+-+Parnell+Shops&amp;toCoordinates=-36.85301%2C174.77903" title="Britomart to Parnell" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-05T16%3A40%3A30%2B13%3A00&amp;time=4%3A45pm&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=7018+-+Stop+C+Queens+Arcade&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.8449%2C174.76779&amp;toAddress=7188+-+Parnell+Shops&amp;toCoordinates=-36.85301%2C174.77903">Britomart (7018)</a> or near the <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-05T16%3A40%3A30%2B13%3A00&amp;time=4%3A45pm&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=1089+-+International+Convention+Centre&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.84964%2C174.76023&amp;toAddress=7188+-+Parnell+Shops&amp;toCoordinates=-36.85301%2C174.77903" title="Sky Tower to Parnell" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-05T16%3A40%3A30%2B13%3A00&amp;time=4%3A45pm&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=1089+-+International+Convention+Centre&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.84964%2C174.76023&amp;toAddress=7188+-+Parnell+Shops&amp;toCoordinates=-36.85301%2C174.77903">Sky Tower (1089)</a>. Ride 10 minutes then get off your bus at the Parnell Shops (7188).</p>
<h5>Wynyard Quarter</h5>
<p>Make your way back to central Auckland for lunch in Wynyard Quarter. Take a 10-minute bus ride from the <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-07T00%3A00%3A00%2B13%3A00&amp;time=4%3A45pm&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=7187+-+Parnell+Shops&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.85364%2C174.77928&amp;toAddress=Wynyard+Quarter%2C+82+Wyndham+St%2C+Auckland+Central%2C+Auckland%2C+1010&amp;toCoordinates=-36.84108347%2C174.75813739&amp;_gl=1*181ud3l*_gcl_au*OTk5Njc1ODA5LjE3NjExODcwNjY.*_ga*MjY5MjU0MzY1LjE3NjExODcwNjc.*_ga_WNC2W47P8Y*czE3NjI0NzQ1NzIkbzE3JGcxJHQxNzYyNDc0NjMyJGo2MCRsMCRoMA..&amp;searchType=TIME_MODE" title="Parnell to Wynyard Quarter" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-07T00%3A00%3A00%2B13%3A00&amp;time=4%3A45pm&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=7187+-+Parnell+Shops&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.85364%2C174.77928&amp;toAddress=Wynyard+Quarter%2C+82+Wyndham+St%2C+Auckland+Central%2C+Auckland%2C+1010&amp;toCoordinates=-36.84108347%2C174.75813739&amp;_gl=1*181ud3l*_gcl_au*OTk5Njc1ODA5LjE3NjExODcwNjY.*_ga*MjY5MjU0MzY1LjE3NjExODcwNjc.*_ga_WNC2W47P8Y*czE3NjI0NzQ1NzIkbzE3JGcxJHQxNzYyNDc0NjMyJGo2MCRsMCRoMA..&amp;searchType=TIME_MODE">Parnell shops (7187)</a> back to Britomart precinct (7016). Walk for 15 minutes along the Auckland waterfront and past the Viaduct Harbour to Wynyard Quarter.</p>
<h5>Ponsonby Road</h5>
<p>Catch the bus from <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-05T16%3A40%3A30%2B13%3A00&amp;time=4%3A45pm&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=1061+-+Wynyard+Quarter&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.8405%2C174.75563&amp;toAddress=7215+-+Ponsonby+Road%2FPicton+Street&amp;toCoordinates=-36.85659%2C174.74717" title="Wynyard Quarter to Ponsonby Road" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-05T16%3A40%3A30%2B13%3A00&amp;time=4%3A45pm&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=1061+-+Wynyard+Quarter&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.8405%2C174.75563&amp;toAddress=7215+-+Ponsonby+Road%2FPicton+Street&amp;toCoordinates=-36.85659%2C174.74717">Wynyard Quarter (1061)</a> to Ponsonby Road (7215) for ice cream. This takes 9 minutes.</p>
<h5>Karangahape Road</h5>
<p>Get drinks and dinner on one of Auckland’s liveliest streets. Ride 5 minutes on the bus from <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-05T16%3A40%3A30%2B13%3A00&amp;time=4%3A45pm&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=7215+-+Ponsonby+Road%2FPicton+Street&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.85659%2C174.74717&amp;toAddress=7131+-+Karangahape+Road%2FQueen+Street&amp;toCoordinates=-36.85787%2C174.76084" title="Ponsonby Road to Karangahape Road" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-05T16%3A40%3A30%2B13%3A00&amp;time=4%3A45pm&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=7215+-+Ponsonby+Road%2FPicton+Street&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.85659%2C174.74717&amp;toAddress=7131+-+Karangahape+Road%2FQueen+Street&amp;toCoordinates=-36.85787%2C174.76084">Ponsonby Road (7215)</a> to Karangahape Road (7131).</p>


</at-text-block>



    <div class="at-col-span-100">
        <at-supporting-image
            fit="cover"
            image-title=""
            heading-level="h3"
            heading-style="atn-heading5"
            image-url="/media/uxte30h4/auckland-transport-cafe-friends-laughing.jpg?mode=crop&amp;width=1535&amp;format=jpg"
            image-alt="Four friends getting a meal."
            image-caption=""
            ratio="a4:landscape"
            width="50%">

            <source slot="source" type="image/webp" media="(max-width: 359px)" srcset="/media/uxte30h4/auckland-transport-cafe-friends-laughing.jpg?mode=crop&amp;width=359&amp;format=webp">
            <source slot="source" type="image/webp" media="(max-width: 639px)" srcset="/media/uxte30h4/auckland-transport-cafe-friends-laughing.jpg?mode=crop&amp;width=639&amp;format=webp">
            <source slot="source" type="image/webp" media="(max-width: 1023px)" srcset="/media/uxte30h4/auckland-transport-cafe-friends-laughing.jpg?mode=crop&amp;width=1023&amp;format=webp">
            <source slot="source" type="image/webp" media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="/media/uxte30h4/auckland-transport-cafe-friends-laughing.jpg?mode=crop&amp;width=1535&amp;format=webp">

            <source slot="source" type="image/jpeg" media="(max-width: 359px)" srcset="/media/uxte30h4/auckland-transport-cafe-friends-laughing.jpg?mode=crop&amp;width=359&amp;format=jpg">
            <source slot="source" type="image/jpeg" media="(max-width: 639px)" srcset="/media/uxte30h4/auckland-transport-cafe-friends-laughing.jpg?mode=crop&amp;width=639&amp;format=jpg">
            <source slot="source" type="image/jpeg" media="(max-width: 1023px)" srcset="/media/uxte30h4/auckland-transport-cafe-friends-laughing.jpg?mode=crop&amp;width=1023&amp;format=jpg">
            <source slot="source" type="image/jpeg" media="(min-width: 1024px)" srcset="/media/uxte30h4/auckland-transport-cafe-friends-laughing.jpg?mode=crop&amp;width=1535&amp;format=jpg">
        </at-supporting-image>
    </div>



                    </div>

                </at-accordion-panel>
            </at-accordion-section>
            <at-accordion-section>
                <at-accordion-toggle 
                    subtitle="" 
                    toggle-id="toggle-u-accordion-1-2" 
                    panel-id="panel-u-accordion-1-2">
                    Family fun
                </at-accordion-toggle>

                <at-accordion-panel 
                    toggle-id="toggle-u-accordion-1-2" 
                    panel-id="panel-u-accordion-1-2">
                    
                    <div class="at-d-grid at-rowgap-6 at-rowgap-md-7 at-px-4 at-mb-4 at-mt-1">
                        






<at-text-block class="at-col-span-100" theme="white">

    <p>Head to a couple of Auckland’s most popular attractions.</p>
<h5>Kelly Tarlton’s</h5>
<p>New Zealand’s most iconic aquarium is just 12 minutes from Britomart. Bus from <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=7019+-+Commerce+Street&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.84515%2C174.76813&amp;toAddress=7320+-+Kelly+Tarlton%27s&amp;toCoordinates=-36.84655%2C174.81712" title="Commerce Street to Kelly Tarlton's" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=7019+-+Commerce+Street&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.84515%2C174.76813&amp;toAddress=7320+-+Kelly+Tarlton%27s&amp;toCoordinates=-36.84655%2C174.81712">Commerce Street (7019)</a> to Kelly Tarlton’s (7320).</p>
<h5>Auckland city centre</h5>
<p>Bus 12 minutes back to Commerce Street (7019) from <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=7323+-+Kelly+Tarlton%27s&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.8477%2C174.81765&amp;toAddress=7019+-+Commerce+Street&amp;toCoordinates=-36.84515%2C174.76813" title="Kelly Tarlton's to Commerce Street" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=7323+-+Kelly+Tarlton%27s&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.8477%2C174.81765&amp;toAddress=7019+-+Commerce+Street&amp;toCoordinates=-36.84515%2C174.76813">Kelly Tarlton’s (7323)</a>.</p>
<h5>Auckland War Memorial Museum</h5>
<p>A world-class museum in a hundred-year-old building. It overlooks the city from the Auckland Domain. Ride 6 minutes on the bus from <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-07T00%3A00%3A00%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=10&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=INN&amp;showExternalProviders=false&amp;preferredRoute=FEWEST_TRANSFERS&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=7018+-+Stop+C+Queens+Arcade&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.8449%2C174.76779&amp;toAddress=Auckland+War+Memorial+Museum%2C+Parnell%2C+Auckland%2C+1010&amp;toCoordinates=-36.860706%2C174.777754&amp;searchType=TIME_MODE&amp;_gl=1*6g16wo*_gcl_au*OTk5Njc1ODA5LjE3NjExODcwNjY.*_ga*MjY5MjU0MzY1LjE3NjExODcwNjc.*_ga_WNC2W47P8Y*czE3NjI0Nzk2ODEkbzE4JGcxJHQxNzYyNDgwNTQ5JGo1NyRsMCRoMA.." title="Britomart to the Museum" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-07T00%3A00%3A00%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=10&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=INN&amp;showExternalProviders=false&amp;preferredRoute=FEWEST_TRANSFERS&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=7018+-+Stop+C+Queens+Arcade&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.8449%2C174.76779&amp;toAddress=Auckland+War+Memorial+Museum%2C+Parnell%2C+Auckland%2C+1010&amp;toCoordinates=-36.860706%2C174.777754&amp;searchType=TIME_MODE&amp;_gl=1*6g16wo*_gcl_au*OTk5Njc1ODA5LjE3NjExODcwNjY.*_ga*MjY5MjU0MzY1LjE3NjExODcwNjc.*_ga_WNC2W47P8Y*czE3NjI0Nzk2ODEkbzE4JGcxJHQxNzYyNDgwNTQ5JGo1NyRsMCRoMA..">Britomart precinct (7018)</a> to Ayr Street (7196). Walk 8 minutes along Domain Drive to Auckland War Memorial Museum.</p>


</at-text-block>



