    </div>



                    </div>

                </at-accordion-panel>
            </at-accordion-section>
            <at-accordion-section>
                <at-accordion-toggle 
                    subtitle="" 
                    toggle-id="toggle-u-accordion-1-3" 
                    panel-id="panel-u-accordion-1-3">
                    Wynyard Quarter and Devonport
                </at-accordion-toggle>

                <at-accordion-panel 
                    toggle-id="toggle-u-accordion-1-3" 
                    panel-id="panel-u-accordion-1-3">
                    
                    <div class="at-d-grid at-rowgap-6 at-rowgap-md-7 at-px-4 at-mb-4 at-mt-1">
                        






<at-text-block class="at-col-span-100" theme="white">

    <p>Dine outdoors then take a short ferry ride to the quaint seaside village of Devonport.</p>
<h5>Wynyard Quarter</h5>
<p>Head to Wynyard Quarter, a waterfront precinct known for its relaxed vibe, scenic location and modern New Zealand cuisine. From the Downtown Ferry Terminal, walk 15 minutes along the Auckland Waterfront. Keep going past the Viaduct Harbour to Wynyard Quarter.</p>
<h5>Devonport</h5>
<p>Enjoy the heritage and coastal beauty of Devonport, accessible by a relaxing and affordable ferry ride. Walk back to the <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=Ferry+Terminal+Downtown%2C+Auckland+Central%2C+Auckland%2C+1010&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.84269159%2C174.76704929&amp;toAddress=Devonport+Ferry+Terminal%2C+1+Queens+Parade%2C+Devonport%2C+Auckland%2C+0624&amp;toCoordinates=-36.83336153%2C174.79560785" title="Downtown to Devonport" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=Ferry+Terminal+Downtown%2C+Auckland+Central%2C+Auckland%2C+1010&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.84269159%2C174.76704929&amp;toAddress=Devonport+Ferry+Terminal%2C+1+Queens+Parade%2C+Devonport%2C+Auckland%2C+0624&amp;toCoordinates=-36.83336153%2C174.79560785">Downtown Ferry Terminal (15 minutes)</a>. Then take the 12-minute ferry ride to Devonport.</p>


</at-text-block>



