                </at-accordion-panel>
            </at-accordion-section>
            <at-accordion-section>
                <at-accordion-toggle 
                    subtitle="" 
                    toggle-id="toggle-u-accordion-1-4" 
                    panel-id="panel-u-accordion-1-4">
                    Harbour Bridge views and Takapuna
                </at-accordion-toggle>

                <at-accordion-panel 
                    toggle-id="toggle-u-accordion-1-4" 
                    panel-id="panel-u-accordion-1-4">
                    
                    <div class="at-d-grid at-rowgap-6 at-rowgap-md-7 at-px-4 at-mb-4 at-mt-1">
                        






<at-text-block class="at-col-span-100" theme="white">

    <p>A short bus ride over the harbour bridge to the beach suburb of Takapuna for shopping, water activities and outdoor dining.</p>
<h5>Takapuna</h5>
<p>Take the short scenic bus ride with views of the sparkling Waitematā Harbour and city skyline to Takapuna. This is a vibrant beachside suburb with a stunning white sand beach and lively hospitality scene. Catch the 82 bus from <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=1332+-+SkyCity+Auckland&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.85025%2C174.76189&amp;toAddress=3568+-+Stop+B+Takapuna&amp;toCoordinates=-36.78796%2C174.77124" title="SkyCity to Takapuna" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=1332+-+SkyCity+Auckland&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.85025%2C174.76189&amp;toAddress=3568+-+Stop+B+Takapuna&amp;toCoordinates=-36.78796%2C174.77124">SkyCity Auckland stop (1332)</a>. Ride for 17 minutes across the Harbour Bridge to Takapuna (3568).</p>
<h5>Back to the city centre</h5>
<p>Take the bus back from <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=3551+-+Stop+A+Takapuna&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.78831%2C174.77162&amp;toAddress=7041+-+Wellesley+Street%2FFederal+Street&amp;toCoordinates=-36.85017%2C174.76223" title="Takapuna to Wellesley Street" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=3551+-+Stop+A+Takapuna&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.78831%2C174.77162&amp;toAddress=7041+-+Wellesley+Street%2FFederal+Street&amp;toCoordinates=-36.85017%2C174.76223">Takapuna (3551)</a>. Ride 17 minutes to Wellesley Street (7041).</p>


</at-text-block>



