                </at-accordion-panel>
            </at-accordion-section>
            <at-accordion-section>
                <at-accordion-toggle 
                    subtitle="" 
                    toggle-id="toggle-u-accordion-1-5" 
                    panel-id="panel-u-accordion-1-5">
                    History
                </at-accordion-toggle>

                <at-accordion-panel 
                    toggle-id="toggle-u-accordion-1-5" 
                    panel-id="panel-u-accordion-1-5">
                    
                    <div class="at-d-grid at-rowgap-6 at-rowgap-md-7 at-px-4 at-mb-4 at-mt-1">
                        






<at-text-block class="at-col-span-100" theme="white">

    <p>See world-class exhibitions in Auckland’s architecturally-renowned museums.</p>
<h5>Auckland War Memorial Museum</h5>
<p>Head to the Auckland War Memorial Museum for world-class exhibitions. Get on the bus at <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-07T00%3A00%3A00%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=10&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=false&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=7018+-+Stop+C+Queens+Arcade&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.8449%2C174.76779&amp;toAddress=Auckland+War+Memorial+Museum%2C+Parnell%2C+Auckland%2C+1010&amp;toCoordinates=-36.860706%2C174.777754&amp;_gl=1*13xyadr*_gcl_au*OTk5Njc1ODA5LjE3NjExODcwNjY.*_ga*MjY5MjU0MzY1LjE3NjExODcwNjc.*_ga_WNC2W47P8Y*czE3NjI0NzQ1NzIkbzE3JGcxJHQxNzYyNDc0OTI5JGo0MiRsMCRoMA..&amp;searchType=TIME_MODE" title="Britomart to the Museum" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-07T00%3A00%3A00%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=10&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=false&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=7018+-+Stop+C+Queens+Arcade&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.8449%2C174.76779&amp;toAddress=Auckland+War+Memorial+Museum%2C+Parnell%2C+Auckland%2C+1010&amp;toCoordinates=-36.860706%2C174.777754&amp;_gl=1*13xyadr*_gcl_au*OTk5Njc1ODA5LjE3NjExODcwNjY.*_ga*MjY5MjU0MzY1LjE3NjExODcwNjc.*_ga_WNC2W47P8Y*czE3NjI0NzQ1NzIkbzE3JGcxJHQxNzYyNDc0OTI5JGo0MiRsMCRoMA..&amp;searchType=TIME_MODE">Britomart (7018)</a> and ride 6 minutes to Ayr Street (7196). Walk 8 minutes along Domain Drive to Auckland War Memorial Museum.</p>
<h5>Auckland Art Gallery</h5>
<p>New Zealand’s largest and most inspiring art gallery, featuring over 17,000 artworks. Walk 8 minutes from the Auckland War Memorial Museum to <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-07T00%3A00%3A00%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=10&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=OUT&amp;searchType=TIME_MODE&amp;showExternalProviders=false&amp;preferredRoute=FEWEST_TRANSFERS&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=Auckland+War+Memorial+Museum%2C+Parnell%2C+Auckland%2C+1010&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.860706%2C174.777754&amp;toAddress=Auckland+Art+Gallery%2C+Auckland+Central%2C+Auckland%2C+1010&amp;toCoordinates=-36.8523273%2C174.7670476" title="Museum to gallery" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-07T00%3A00%3A00%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=10&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=OUT&amp;searchType=TIME_MODE&amp;showExternalProviders=false&amp;preferredRoute=FEWEST_TRANSFERS&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=Auckland+War+Memorial+Museum%2C+Parnell%2C+Auckland%2C+1010&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.860706%2C174.777754&amp;toAddress=Auckland+Art+Gallery%2C+Auckland+Central%2C+Auckland%2C+1010&amp;toCoordinates=-36.8523273%2C174.7670476">Ayr Street (7195)</a>. Ride 11 minutes on the bus toward the city centre and get off near Auckland University of Technology (AUT) (7089). From there, it is a 3-minute walk to the Auckland Art Gallery.</p>


</at-text-block>



