<at-text-block class="at-col-span-100" theme="white">

    <p>Experience Auckland's incredible wildlife, from whale and dolphin encounters in the Hauraki Gulf to spotting a kiwi at the Auckland Zoo.</p>
<h5>Whale and dolphin spotting</h5>
<p>Lucky passengers on Auckland’s ferries may spot dolphins in the wild. From the Downtown Ferry Terminal, take the ferry to:</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=Ferry+Terminal+Downtown%2C+Auckland+Central%2C+Auckland%2C+1010&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.84269159%2C174.76704929&amp;toAddress=Devonport+Ferry+Terminal%2C+1+Queens+Parade%2C+Devonport%2C+Auckland%2C+0624&amp;toCoordinates=-36.83336153%2C174.79560785" title="Downtown to Devonport" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=Ferry+Terminal+Downtown%2C+Auckland+Central%2C+Auckland%2C+1010&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.84269159%2C174.76704929&amp;toAddress=Devonport+Ferry+Terminal%2C+1+Queens+Parade%2C+Devonport%2C+Auckland%2C+0624&amp;toCoordinates=-36.83336153%2C174.79560785">Devonport (12 minutes)</a></li>
<li><a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=Ferry+Terminal+Downtown%2C+Auckland+Central%2C+Auckland%2C+1010&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.84269159%2C174.76704929&amp;toAddress=61000+-+Ferry+Terminal+-+Waiheke&amp;toCoordinates=-36.78076%2C174.99142" title="Downtown to Waiheke Island" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=Ferry+Terminal+Downtown%2C+Auckland+Central%2C+Auckland%2C+1010&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.84269159%2C174.76704929&amp;toAddress=61000+-+Ferry+Terminal+-+Waiheke&amp;toCoordinates=-36.78076%2C174.99142">Waiheke Island (40 minutes)</a></li>
<li><a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=Ferry+Terminal+Downtown%2C+Auckland+Central%2C+Auckland%2C+1010&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.84269159%2C174.76704929&amp;toAddress=97001+-+Ferry+Terminal+-+Half+Moon+Bay&amp;toCoordinates=-36.87993%2C174.89532" title="Downtown to Half Moon Bay" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-06T11%3A45%3A24%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=Ferry+Terminal+Downtown%2C+Auckland+Central%2C+Auckland%2C+1010&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.84269159%2C174.76704929&amp;toAddress=97001+-+Ferry+Terminal+-+Half+Moon+Bay&amp;toCoordinates=-36.87993%2C174.89532">Half Moon Bay (40 minutes)</a>.</li>
</ul>
<p>Otherwise, walk 8 minutes to the Viaduct Harbour to find dolphin and whale safari tours.</p>
<h5>Auckland Zoo</h5>
<p>Get on the bus at <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-07T00%3A00%3A00%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=1005+-+Stop+D+Lower+Albert&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.84353%2C174.76571&amp;toAddress=Auckland+Zoo%2C+Western+Springs%2C+Auckland%2C+1022&amp;toCoordinates=-36.864067%2C174.7197&amp;_gl=1*15hz2pb*_gcl_au*OTk5Njc1ODA5LjE3NjExODcwNjY.*_ga*MjY5MjU0MzY1LjE3NjExODcwNjc.*_ga_WNC2W47P8Y*czE3NjI0NzQ1NzIkbzE3JGcxJHQxNzYyNDc1MzgyJGo1NyRsMCRoMA..&amp;searchType=TIME_MODE" title="Lower Albert Street to Auckland Zoo" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-07T00%3A00%3A00%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=1005+-+Stop+D+Lower+Albert&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.84353%2C174.76571&amp;toAddress=Auckland+Zoo%2C+Western+Springs%2C+Auckland%2C+1022&amp;toCoordinates=-36.864067%2C174.7197&amp;_gl=1*15hz2pb*_gcl_au*OTk5Njc1ODA5LjE3NjExODcwNjY.*_ga*MjY5MjU0MzY1LjE3NjExODcwNjc.*_ga_WNC2W47P8Y*czE3NjI0NzQ1NzIkbzE3JGcxJHQxNzYyNDc1MzgyJGo1NyRsMCRoMA..&amp;searchType=TIME_MODE">Stop D Lower Albert (1005)</a> and ride for 15 minutes to Auckland Zoo (stop 8124).</p>


</at-text-block>



