            </at-accordion-section>
            <at-accordion-section>
                <at-accordion-toggle 
                    subtitle="" 
                    toggle-id="toggle-u-accordion-1-8" 
                    panel-id="panel-u-accordion-1-8">
                    Exciting adventures
                </at-accordion-toggle>

                <at-accordion-panel 
                    toggle-id="toggle-u-accordion-1-8" 
                    panel-id="panel-u-accordion-1-8">
                    
                    <div class="at-d-grid at-rowgap-6 at-rowgap-md-7 at-px-4 at-mb-4 at-mt-1">
                        






<at-text-block class="at-col-span-100" theme="white">

    <p>A full day of thrills, from water sports to conquering the heights of the Harbour Bridge with a climb or bungy jump.</p>
<h5>Z Pier water sports</h5>
<p>Bus to Z Pier for water sports like kayaking, jetboating and jet skiing. To get there, go to <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-07T00%3A00%3A00%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=1002+-+Stop+A+Lower+Albert&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.84316%2C174.76576&amp;toAddress=Z+Pier%2C+31+Westhaven+Dr%2C+Saint+Marys+Bay%2C+Auckland%2C+1011&amp;toCoordinates=-36.842334%2C174.75039868&amp;_gl=1*1gzvwl9*_gcl_au*OTk5Njc1ODA5LjE3NjExODcwNjY.*_ga*MjY5MjU0MzY1LjE3NjExODcwNjc.*_ga_WNC2W47P8Y*czE3NjI0NzQ1NzIkbzE3JGcxJHQxNzYyNDc1NDMyJGo3JGwwJGgw&amp;searchType=TIME_MODE" title="Lower Albert Street to Z Pier" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-07T00%3A00%3A00%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=1002+-+Stop+A+Lower+Albert&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.84316%2C174.76576&amp;toAddress=Z+Pier%2C+31+Westhaven+Dr%2C+Saint+Marys+Bay%2C+Auckland%2C+1011&amp;toCoordinates=-36.842334%2C174.75039868&amp;_gl=1*1gzvwl9*_gcl_au*OTk5Njc1ODA5LjE3NjExODcwNjY.*_ga*MjY5MjU0MzY1LjE3NjExODcwNjc.*_ga_WNC2W47P8Y*czE3NjI0NzQ1NzIkbzE3JGcxJHQxNzYyNDc1NDMyJGo3JGwwJGgw&amp;searchType=TIME_MODE">Stop A Lower Albert (1002)</a> or <a href="https://at.govt.nz/bus-train-ferry/journey-planner?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-07T00%3A00%3A00%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=1006+-+Stop+E+Lower+Albert&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.8429%2C174.76532&amp;toAddress=Z+Pier%2C+31+Westhaven+Dr%2C+Saint+Marys+Bay%2C+Auckland%2C+1011&amp;toCoordinates=-36.842334%2C174.75039868&amp;_gl=1*1gzvwl9*_gcl_au*OTk5Njc1ODA5LjE3NjExODcwNjY.*_ga*MjY5MjU0MzY1LjE3NjExODcwNjc.*_ga_WNC2W47P8Y*czE3NjI0NzQ1NzIkbzE3JGcxJHQxNzYyNDc1NDMyJGo3JGwwJGgw&amp;searchType=TIME_MODE" title="Lower Albert Street to Z Pier" data-anchor="?timeMode=Leaving+now&amp;date=2025-11-07T00%3A00%3A00%2B13%3A00&amp;time=11%3A50am&amp;transportMode=bus%2Cferry%2Ctrain%2Cschoolbus&amp;fareType=ADULT&amp;maxWalkingTime=20&amp;walkingSpeed=4.5&amp;routeFilter=&amp;showExternalProviders=true&amp;preferredRoute=FASTEST&amp;tab=pt&amp;fromAddress=1006+-+Stop+E+Lower+Albert&amp;fromCoordinates=-36.8429%2C174.76532&amp;toAddress=Z+Pier%2C+31+Westhaven+Dr%2C+Saint+Marys+Bay%2C+Auckland%2C+1011&amp;toCoordinates=-36.842334%2C174.75039868&amp;_gl=1*1gzvwl9*_gcl_au*OTk5Njc1ODA5LjE3NjExODcwNjY.*_ga*MjY5MjU0MzY1LjE3NjExODcwNjc.*_ga_WNC2W47P8Y*czE3NjI0NzQ1NzIkbzE3JGcxJHQxNzYyNDc1NDMyJGo3JGwwJGgw&amp;searchType=TIME_MODE">Stop E Lower Albert (1006)</a>. Ride 4 minutes to stop 7036.</p>
<p>Z Pier is 7 minutes’ walk from stop 7036.</p>
<h5>Auckland Harbour Bridge</h5>
<p>Climb the Harbour Bridge or bungy jump off the top of it. The Harbour Bridge is a 20-minute walk from Z Pier.</p>


</at-text-block>



